<p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">A scam can leave you unsure whether to protect your money, your account or your device first. Start with the action that could prevent further loss. A clicked link alone is not a safety verdict, while credentials, payment details or remote access can require more urgent steps.</p>{% call note("care", "Take care", "money comes first") %}<p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">If money is at risk, contact your bank or card provider now using details from an official app, statement or website you already trust. Do not wait for an appointment, and do not pay anyone who promises to recover your money.</p>{% endcall %}
